WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.362 --> 00:00:02.070
RETO MEIER: Colt,
welcome to Whack-a-Pod.

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:04.710
Would you like to try your
hand at taking out a Kubernetes

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.687
cluster by whacking each
Kubernetes pod, one at a time?

00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:10.020
COLT MCANLIS: Any time I get
to hit stuff with a mallet,

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:10.890
it's a good day.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.000
RETO MEIER: All right,
let's give it a try.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000
COLT MCANLIS: All right.

00:00:15.137 --> 00:00:17.220
RETO MEIER: So we have
that Kubernetes service up.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.839
Every one of these gopher
pods you're hitting

00:00:19.839 --> 00:00:21.130
is taking out a Kubernetes pod.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.580
As you can see, the
system is designed

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.980
to be extremely resilient.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.780
It's going to continue to
bring these services back up,

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.550
while you try and
take them down,

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:35.214
making it very difficult to
actually take them all out.

00:00:35.214 --> 00:00:36.130
He's struggling there.

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:37.514
Do you want me to give it a try?

00:00:37.514 --> 00:00:39.180
COLT MCANLIS: I can't
get them all down.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.721
RETO MEIER: Let's
see if I can do it.

00:00:42.337 --> 00:00:43.170
It wasn't that hard.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:45.840
I don't know why
you were struggling.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.390
COLT MCANLIS: Cheater.

